<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.0.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" integrity="sha384-EVSTQN3/azprG1Anm3QDgpJLIm9Nao0Yz1ztcQTwFspd3yD65VohhpuuCOmLASjC" crossorigin="anonymous">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <title>Selamat Datang di Setneg</title>
    <style type="text/css">
        * {
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0;
        }

        body {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            max-width: 720px;
            max-height: 940px;
        }

        a {
            color: #FE9516;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 400;
            color: #444444;
            line-height: 24px;
            margin: unset;
        }

        p span {
            color: #FE9516;
        }

        h4, h6 {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            width: 308px;
            margin: 0 auto 20px auto;
            padding: 12px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 500;
            background-color: #FE9516;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }
        .btn-primary:hover,
        .btn-primary:active,
        .btn-primary:focus {
            background-color: #D47C12;
            border: none;
            box-shadow: none;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            padding: 60px 0;
        }

        .header {
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .header .header-logo {
            width: 320px;
            height: 63px;
            margin: 0 auto 12px auto;
        }

        .header .header-logo img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
        }

        .header .header-address p {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 500;
            line-height: 20px;
        }

        .content h4,
        .content p {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .content .user-auth {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .content .user-auth p {
            margin-bottom: unset;
        }

        .content .user-auth span {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #444444;
        }

        .content .course {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .content .course-kupon {
            min-width: 204px;
            height: 104px;
            padding: 16px 40px;
            text-align: center;
            background-color: #FFEAD0;
            border: 1px solid #FE9516;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }

        .content .course-kupon p {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .content .course-kupon h2 {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #FE9516;
        }

        .content .btn-primary {
            margin: 0 auto 20px auto;
            align-self: center;
        }

        .content .regards h6 {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 500;
            line-height: 24px;
        }

        .footer {
            padding: 24px 60px;
            background-color: #444444;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .footer .message-footer {
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 400;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .footer .info-footer {
            height: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 44px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .footer .info-footer a {
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .footer .info-footer .faq {
            height: 32px;
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
        }
        
        .footer .info-footer .social-media {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            right: 0;
        }

        .footer .info-footer .social-media .social-media-item {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            margin: 0 7px;
        }

        .footer .info-footer .social-media .social-media-item img {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
        }
    </style>
    <style>
        @media screen and (max-width: 450px) {
            body {
                max-width: 100%;
                max-height: 100%;
            }

            h4, h6 {
                font-size: 16px;
            }

            .btn-primary {
                width: 270px;
                font-size: 14px;
            }

            .container {
                max-width: 100%;
                padding: 40px 26px;
            }

            .header .header-logo {
                width: 100%;
                height: fit-content;
            }

            .header .header-logo img {
                width: 100%;
                height: 100%;
            }

            .content h4,
            .content p {
                margin-bottom: 16px;
            }

            .content .regards {
                margin-bottom: unset;
            }

            .footer {
                padding: 24px 30px;
            }

            .footer .info-footer {
                margin-bottom: 36px;
            }

            .footer .info-footer .social-media .social-media-item {
                width: 24px;
                height: 24px;
            }
            
            .footer .info-footer .social-media .social-media-item img {
                width: 24px;
                height: 24px;
            }
        }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="main-wrapper">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header">
                <div class="header-logo">
                    <img src="{{baseUrl}}images/logo-setneg.png" alt="Logo Setneg">
                </div>
                <div class="header-address">
                    <p>
                        Jalan Gaharu I. No.1, Kel. Cipete Selatan,<br />
                        Kec. Cilandak, Jakarta Selatan, 12430
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="content" >
                <div class="body-content">
                    <h4>
                        Selamat Datang di Setneg Playbook
                    </h4>
                    <p>
                        Anda bisa mengakses Setneg Playbook menggunakan akun :
                    </p>
                    <div class="user-auth">
                        <p>
                            Email :
                            <span>{{email}}</span>
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            Password :
                            <span>{{password}}</span>
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <p>
                        Selanjutnya, Anda bisa mengakses Setneg Playbook melalui tombol di bawah ini.
                    </p>
                    <div style="text-align: center;">
                        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{frontendUrl}}" role="button" style="background-color: #FE9516; border-color: #FE9516;">
                            Login Setneg Playbook
                        </a>
                    </div>
                    <p>
                        Jika Anda mengalami kendala dengan tombol di atas, Anda bisa klik link di bawah ini. <br/>
                        <span>
                            <a href="{{frontendUrl}}" style="color: #FE9516;">
                                {{frontendUrl}}
                            </a>
                        </span>
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="regards">
                    <p>
                        Terimakasih.
                    </p>
                    <h6>
                        Setneg Playbook<br/>The Ultimate Learning Hub
                    </h6>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
    <footer class="footer">
        <div class="info-footer">
            <a class="faq" href="#" style="text-decoration: none;">
                FAQ
            </a>
            <div class="social-media">
                <a class="social-media-item" href="{{facebookUrl}}">
                    <img src="{{baseUrl}}images/facebook.png" alt="Social Media" />
                </a>
                <a class="social-media-item" href="{{twitterUrl}}">
                    <img src="{{baseUrl}}images/twitter.png" alt="Social Media" />
                </a>
                <a class="social-media-item" href="{{instagramUrl}}">
                    <img src="{{baseUrl}}images/instagram.png" alt="Social Media" />
                </a>
                <a class="social-media-item" href="{{whatsappUrl}}">
                    <img src="{{baseUrl}}images/whatsapp.png" alt="Social Media" />
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <p class="message-footer">
            Harap jangan membalas e-mail ini, karena e-mail ini dikirimkan secara otomatis oleh sistem.
        </p>
    </footer>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.0.2/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js" integrity="sha384-MrcW6ZMFYlzcLA8Nl+NtUVF0sA7MsXsP1UyJoMp4YLEuNSfAP+JcXn/tWtIaxVXM" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
  </body>
</html>
